[{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「今天一天也辛苦你了，阿将」","art":{"background":"a1700","sprites":[{"asset":"a994","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「芦花姐，你也辛苦了」","art":{"background":"a1700","sprites":[{"asset":"a994","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「嗯，谢谢……不对，我还没算总账呢」","art":{"background":"a1700","sprites":[{"asset":"a1567","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1700","sprites":[{"asset":"a1567","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「芦花姐，我想跟你说件事」","art":{"background":"a1700","sprites":[{"asset":"a1567","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「说事？这么正式，什么事啊？」","art":{"background":"a1700","sprites":[{"asset":"a1029","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"芦花姐整理好姿势，正面对着我。","art":{"background":"a1700","sprites":[{"asset":"a1029","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊，没，在这里有点不太方便……」","art":{"background":"a1700","sprites":[{"asset":"a1029","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「要是你方便的话可以来我房间吗？」","art":{"background":"a1700","sprites":[{"asset":"a1029","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「是吗？嗯，好的——咦？」","art":{"background":"a1700","sprites":[{"asset":"a4201","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「去、去阿将的房间……现、现在？」","art":{"background":"a1700","sprites":[{"asset":"a4187","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不是现在也行……」","art":{"background":"a1700","sprites":[{"asset":"a4187","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「如果你接下来没事的话……希望你今晚可以来我房间」","art":{"background":"a1700","sprites":[{"asset":"a4187","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1700","sprites":[{"asset":"a4202","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「你的意思是……」","art":{"background":"a1700","sprites":[{"asset":"a4190","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「难道说——」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「随便坐吧」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「好、好的，我不客气了」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4203","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4203","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"感觉……芦花姐看上去很奇怪。","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4203","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「总之先喝杯茶吧？虽然是房间里附带的」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4203","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「好的，我不客气了」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4204","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"芦花姐的声音完全掩饰不住她的紧张。","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4204","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"尽管她的态度让我很疑惑，但我还是给她的杯子里倒上热水开始泡茶。","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"然后我将茶摆在她面前。","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「好了，请用。不过这味道可能入不了专业人士的法眼」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4205","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「别在意，没关系」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4204","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……总之我先去做个准备，你先在这里等我一会儿吧」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4204","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「好的，我明白了」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4206","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「竟、竟然、竟然来了……」","art":{"background":"a4207","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我真的来阿将的房间了。","art":{"background":"a4207","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"半夜，两个人独处……这肯定是——","art":{"background":"a4207","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「想、想要……跟我睡……」","art":{"background":"a4208","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「呀！阿将太大胆了！竟然突然想睡我！」","art":{"background":"a4209","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「这种事情应该一步步来啊……他竟然全数忽略，直奔主题……」","art":{"background":"a4210","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"阿将到底在准备什么？","art":{"background":"a4210","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"难道是想清洁身体，去洗澡了？","art":{"background":"a4210","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「如果是这样，那我也应该去洗个澡让身子干净点……」","art":{"background":"a4210","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「啊……阿将太突然了，怎么一上来就说这种话……我也需要做很多方面的准备啊」","art":{"background":"a4210","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"而且，我也是第一次跟男人睡……得提前预习下相关的知识才行啊。","art":{"background":"a4210","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"这么突然，我可怎么办才好啊……","art":{"background":"a4210","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「太大胆了……可、可是……年轻人，有时候也是也没办法的吧……」","art":{"background":"a4210","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「呜……我、我……能行吗？第一次……我能满足年轻人的欲望吗？」","art":{"background":"a4210","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"啊……好紧张，手在颤抖，心也在跳。","art":{"background":"a4210","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「接、接下来……我要脱掉衣服，赤、赤身裸体……然后，然后……呼，呼，呼，呼」","art":{"background":"a4210","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「啊……我要被阿将羞辱了……」","art":{"background":"a4209","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"感觉好开心，又感觉好想逃……","art":{"background":"a4209","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"可要是现在走了的话……那也挺没礼貌的。","art":{"background":"a4209","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"都、都到了这一步，那就得下定决心。马上我就要将男人的那个纳入体内了……","art":{"background":"a4209","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「……呼，呼，呼，呼，呼，呼……」","art":{"background":"a4211","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「——」","art":{"background":"a4212","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"房门那传来声音。","art":{"background":"a4212","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「回来了————————！」","art":{"background":"a4213","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「我、我……我……呼，呼，呼，呼，呼……」","art":{"background":"a4214","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「久等了，芦花姐」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「你你你你你你回来了，阿将，呼呼呼呼呼」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4215","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「哇！？芦、芦花姐！？你呼吸怎么这么乱啊！？」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4215","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「因为，因为我还是第一次啊……我说，阿将……你手上拿着什么呢？」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4216","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这个啊，这是我想出来的新产品」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4216","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我将端来的玻璃杯放在桌上。","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a5","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"当然，杯子里不是空的，里面放了雪葩一样的东西。","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a5","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「这是什么？是刨冰吗？」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a20","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是类似的东西……总之你先尝尝看」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a20","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「嗯？嗯……好、好的」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a21","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"芦花姐犹犹豫豫地伸出勺子，将冰送到嘴里。","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a21","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「唔……嗯，好冰」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a35","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「味道怎么样？」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a35","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「这是抹茶……？像是在嘴里溶化一样……但是味道也很清晰，很好吃……」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a36","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这个也尝一下吧」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a36","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「这边的是褐色的啊……唔……难道说这是咖啡？」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a43","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是的，两边用的都是田心屋里卖的那种」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a43","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「是吗……感觉介于刨冰和雪葩之间啊。吃完还有余味……挺好吃的」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a20","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这个又叫水晶冰沙，听说就是法式的雪葩」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a20","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「换季之后天气会变热，吃这个正好。而且这个应该不需要辛苦叔叔吧」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a20","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊，当然，也可以用水果来做，也不是非抹茶或者咖啡不行」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「难道说……你叫我来就是为了尝这个？」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a15","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「感觉在店里做实验性的东西也不好，所以回来借用了旅馆的厨房做了这个」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a15","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「做完了就想请你来尝尝……咦，难道说你本来有什么安排的吗？」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a15","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「不是的。不是那回事……唉……感觉之前都白紧张了……」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a45","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……？」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a45","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「既然是这样，那你早说啊……你这笨蛋，笨蛋笨蛋」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4217","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「害我白害羞一场……呜……\n又被羞辱了」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4203","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……我做错了什么吗？」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4203","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「就是因为你什么都没做啊，笨蛋」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4218","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这么不讲道理！？」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4218","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不过，如果确实是我做错了，那就对不起了……芦花姐」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4218","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「……啊……不，应该道歉的是我。是我自己误会了，还拿你出气」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a34","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「辜负了你为店里考虑的一片心意」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a23","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我也不太懂……不过既然你原谅我了那就这样吧」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a23","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「先不说这个了，水晶冰沙你觉得如何？不需要刨冰那样的工具，也没有雪葩那么难做」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a23","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「嗯，主意不错。你说得对，很适合接下来的天气」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a6","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「有很多种类是好事，但那样要做起来就难了……不过我还是想用水果做做看啊」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a4219","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「另外……最好能跟普通的雪葩做出点不一样的特色」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a38","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊，这方面我请教了茂师傅，他说可以给成人准备日本酒」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a38","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「日本酒？这么一说……好像是有日本酒冰淇淋」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a29","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「对，就是那个。这个就是把日本酒做的水晶冰沙盖在了香草冰淇淋上的……尝尝吧」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a29","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「嗯，我试试。唔……嗯……嗯！这个好吃！」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a6","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「有种香草冰淇淋的清爽感，而且加上日本酒，更显出一种奢侈的味道」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a18","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「真的很好吃……唔，唔……」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a36","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a36","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「这个日本酒冰沙加冰淇淋的组合，我挺喜欢的。唔……唔……」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a36","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"芦花姐开心地一勺又一勺吃了起来。","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a36","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……哈哈……」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a36","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"看她吃得那么开心，我的嘴角不禁翘了起来。","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a36","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"自己做的咖啡得到认可时，芦花姐肯定也是像现在的我一样开心。","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"自己的努力让别人得到了快乐……是这样地令人欣喜。","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「唔……唔……」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a37","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……我说，你没事吧？那可是日本酒啊」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a37","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「嗯？没事没事，我都成年了，没问题的」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a18","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不，我不是说年龄，你吃得太快了」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a18","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「没事没事，我紧张得口渴了。而且我喝不醉的，别担心。唔，唔……真好吃」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a23","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯，那就好」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a23","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「唔♪」","art":{"background":"a4007","sprites":[{"asset":"a36","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「阿将……我说，阿将」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「什么，芦花姐」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「我就叫叫你……」","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"这都醉成这幅傻样了！","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"什么喝不醉啊，人都晕了。","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"还紧紧抱着我的脖子……","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"闻着太香了！而且，而且我能感觉到芦花姐的胸部……这次还是从正面感觉到的。","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"芦花姐……真的很大。","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「阿将，阿将」","art":{"background":"a4221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「好好好，我在呢」","art":{"background":"a4221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「我就叫叫你……哈哈哈」","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"看来芦花姐是那种一醉就会变得很开心的人。","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"另外，她还稍稍抱着我。","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"……至少比变得很暴力要好。","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"而且……我也不讨厌被她抱着。","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"不，我说谎了。我不仅没觉得讨厌，甚至还觉得很开心。","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽然她的呼吸带了点酒臭味。","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「……嘻嘻，阿将真可爱……」","art":{"background":"a4221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「谢谢你。但是你更可爱」","art":{"background":"a4221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「真的吗？好开心！嘻嘻嘻」","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"芦花姐笑得很开心，她将身体再贴过来了一些。","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「芦花姐，难道说你不习惯喝酒？」","art":{"background":"a4220","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「嗯……？我不怎么喝的。偶尔会陪人喝……但那种情况下根本喝不开心」","art":{"background":"a4221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"毕竟这种乡下地方上下关系很严格……","art":{"background":"a4221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"不过，这方面芦花姐自己应该也很清楚。","art":{"background":"a4221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"经营店铺不是抱着玩的心态就能办起来的，肯定会很累。","art":{"background":"a4221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"可是……","art":{"background":"a4221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……芦花姐，为什么你会继承店铺？」","art":{"background":"a4221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"阿姨说是因为一时的气话。","art":{"background":"a4221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"一开始和她重逢的时候她也说过类似的话。","art":{"background":"a4221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是……我不觉得她会因为一时赌气就能坚持这么困难的工作。","art":{"background":"a4221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「为什么……到底是为什么呢？」","art":{"background":"a4222","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「小时候我完全没想继承，可是我长大之后……就开始理解父母的辛劳了」","art":{"background":"a4222","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「知道了之后，我就想帮他们忙……开始打下手……」","art":{"background":"a4222","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「然后我才发现这辛苦超乎我想象……一家小店，一边继承传统，一边维系店铺生存，感觉也挺厉害的」","art":{"background":"a4223","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「所以我开始希望有更多人来店。希望更多客人尝到我爸爸做的味道……嘻嘻嘻」","art":{"background":"a4221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是吗……」","art":{"background":"a4221","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「啊，不过这个你可别告诉我爸爸啊」","art":{"background":"a4222","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「好的，我不会说的」","art":{"background":"a4222","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「说好了哦」","art":{"background":"a4222","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「好的好的，说好了说好了」","art":{"background":"a4222","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"说着，我摸了摸她的脑袋。","art":{"background":"a4224","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我抚摸得很温柔，就像在摸小婴儿一样。","art":{"background":"a4224","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「再摸摸吧♪」","art":{"background":"a4225","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「好的，好的，这样可以吧？」","art":{"background":"a4225","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「嗯，谢谢……嘻嘻嘻」","art":{"background":"a4225","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「芦花姐喜欢被摸脑袋吗？」","art":{"background":"a4225","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「喜欢呀。这样被摸脑袋，感觉就像努力得到了承认一样，感觉自己的努力没有白费，好开心」","art":{"background":"a4226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a4226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"是啊……毕竟是一家人。","art":{"background":"a4226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"尽管会夸奖，但这种诚恳地表达的机会可能并不多。","art":{"background":"a4226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「没想到你挺爱撒娇的」","art":{"background":"a4226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「千万别告诉其他人哦」","art":{"background":"a4224","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「好的，我不会告诉叔叔，也不会告诉任何人」","art":{"background":"a4224","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我不会告诉其他人的……所以，你可别对别人这样撒娇哦，芦花姐」","art":{"background":"a4224","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「不会的，我不会这样做的……我只想……向你撒娇」","art":{"background":"a4226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a4226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「芦花姐，你这是……」","art":{"background":"a4226","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「我说，阿将，你为什么愿意付出这么多？」","art":{"background":"a4224","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「你甚至帮咱们店构思新产品，这已经不是兼职员工的分内工作了吧……为什么愿意做这么多？」","art":{"background":"a4224","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这……也许是因为我想让你夸我吧？」","art":{"background":"a4224","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「阿将，你真可爱！」","art":{"background":"a4225","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"芦花姐开心地抱住了我。","art":{"background":"a4225","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"哇！？胸部的感觉越来越……","art":{"background":"a4225","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"不妙，这种情况相当不妙！这样下去我会没法控制自己——嗯！？","art":{"background":"a4225","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「真可爱……嘻嘻嘻……呼……嗯」","art":{"background":"a4227","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「芦、芦花姐，快放开……」","art":{"background":"a4227","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「呼……呼……呼……」","art":{"background":"a4227","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「哎……哎……真的假的？」","art":{"background":"a4227","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"芦花姐紧紧箍着我脖子，开始发出安静的呼吸声。","art":{"background":"a4227","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我说，芦花姐，芦花姐！」","art":{"background":"a4227","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"芦花","text":"「呼……呼……呼……」","art":{"background":"a4228","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……唉……」","art":{"background":"a4228","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"这姿势，我不仅没法换衣，也没法让她换衣。","art":{"background":"a4228","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……这可怎么办……」","art":{"background":"a4228","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"}]